cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cloudfit-provider-aws in your research, please cite it."
type: software
title: "cloudfit-provider-aws: AWS EC2 provider plugin for cloudfit-core"
abstract: >
  cloudfit-provider-aws reads the public AWS EC2 price list, with no AWS
  credentials needed, and normalizes instance types, on-demand and 1-year
  reserved prices, GPU models, and generation status into MachineType objects
  compatible with cloudfit-core's scoring engine.
authors:
